WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.418
Oh wait. You have 
something in your eye.

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:02.377
Oh no.

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:03.962
It’s just sparkle.

00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:05.171
Aaaah!!!!

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.510
Welcome to Charm Battle, 
bitches.

00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:13.555
I’m sorry if I’m been 
following you all night.

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:15.223
My parents always told 
me to follow my dreams.

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:17.225
I’m not an organ donor,

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.436
But I’d be happy to give 
you my heart.

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:20.854
I’ll give you a solid 18.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:21.813
Mira mamacita...

00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:22.856
Oooh! 

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:23.481
You can’t do that.

00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:27.318
I think you’re suffering from
a lack of vitamin me.

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:29.571
Just because you 
were bilingual, 

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:30.780
I’ll give you a 54.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.365
Hey yo Ma, 
I like your jersey.

00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:34.325
Can I have you 
name and number?

00:00:34.951 --> 00:00:38.288
If you were a fruit, 
you’d be a fine-apple.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:40.123
That was so gross.

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:42.792
Can I give like negative 
7 points for that?

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.044
I’m new in town,

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:46.296
Can I have the directions 
to your heart?

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:47.756
I’m gonna give that a 3.

00:00:47.964 --> 00:00:48.757
Lightning round!

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.384
Are you Netflix?  

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.720
Because I could watch 
you for hours.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.388
Let’s commit the 
perfect crime, 

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:58.308
I’ll steal your heart, 
and you’ll steal mine.

00:00:58.308 --> 00:01:00.268
4 + 4 = 8 

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:04.022
But you + me = fate.

00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:05.648
Are you from Starbucks?

00:01:05.648 --> 00:01:07.525
Because I like you a-latte.

00:01:07.525 --> 00:01:09.069
If you were a flower,

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:11.863
You’d be a damn-delion. 

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:13.073
My name isn't Julio, 

00:01:13.782 --> 00:01:15.200
but you tryin’ to 
get to know me?

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.576
Ok guys...

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:17.744
I have a winner.

00:01:18.703 --> 00:01:19.704
The winner is...

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:24.125
Aaahhhh!!!!!

00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:26.461
I can’t compete with this.

00:01:26.711 --> 00:01:28.129
There’s a winner 
in all of us.

